Option 2: Validation Groups (Common in Spring)

Spring can validate only the fields that are present using validation groups.

Example:

@NotBlank(groups = Create.class)
private String employeeName;

This is more advanced, and we'll learn it later.

Option 3: Separate Validator Class (Enterprise Choice) ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

